<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2CO" style="id">- Sefwi New Testament</book>
  <para style="h">2 KORINTOFOƐ</para>
  <para style="toc3">2Ko</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Korintofoɛ</para>
  <para style="toc1">KORINTOFOƐ NWOMAA BƆ ƆTƆ SO NYƆ</para>
  <para style="mt1">KORINTOFOƐ</para>
  <para style="mt4">NWOMAA BƆ ƆTƆ SO NYƆ</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="ip">Somafoɛ Paul hworɔle Korintofoɛ nwomaa bɔ oli moa ne, wangyɛ biala yeɛ ɔhworɔle Korintofoɛ nwomaa bɔ ɔtɔ so nyɔ ne ɔ. Na ɛhene de, ɔhworɔle ye wɔ Makedonia. Ngrataa bɔ Paul hworɔ mane Korintofoɛ asafo ne, ɛhe ne yeɛ ɔtɔ so nná ɔ.—<char style="xt"><ref loc="1CO 5:9">1Ko 5:9</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 2:3-4">2Ko 2:3-4</ref>.</char></para>
  <para style="ip">Nningyein bɔ ɔwɔ 1 Korintofoɛ nanu ne, 2 Korintofoɛ ne ka ebie nwo dwirɛ, na osa ka nningyein foforɛ nwo dwirɛ.</para>
  <para style="ip">Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, né bɛ bɔ bɛdwɔso betia Paul ne bu adwuma bɔ ɔyɛ ne animtia, na ne bɛka kyɛ, amaneɛ bɔ onwu ye ne kyire kyɛ ɔtte somafoɛ pa. Nakoso Paul maa bɛnwuni kyɛ, amaneɛ bɔ onwu ye ne maa Nyameɛ anuonyam ala ali.</para>
  <para style="ip">Wɔ Paul krataa he anu ne;</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Ɔhyɛle aliemaa mɔ bɔ bɛdi nahorɛ wɔ Korinto asafo nanu ne nguraen.</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Ɔmaa bɛnwuni ye kyɛ, odikyɛ bɛfi b'ahone nu bɛboka aliemaa mɔ bɔ bɛ nwo ahyere bɛ wɔ Yudea ne.</para>
  <para style="ipi">• Ɔmane bɛ bɔ bate atua wɔ Korintofoɛ asafo nanu ne ye nwo atee kyɛ bɛsakra kora ne wawa.</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="iot">ENU DWIRƐ</para>
  <para style="io1">Paul ye ye nwo noa wɔ sommoɛ bɔ bafa babɔ ye kyɛ ɔtte somafoɛ pa nanwo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2CO 1:1-7:16">1:1–7:16</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Paul srɛle aliemaa nemɔ kyɛ bɛfi b'ahone nu bɛye ndoboa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2CO 8:1-9:15">8:1–9:15</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Paul srɛle bɛ bɔ bate atua ne kyɛ bɛsakra b'adwene (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2CO 10:1-13:10">10:1–13:10</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="io1">Edwirɛ bɔ ɔpɛ yebo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="2CO 13:11-14">13:11-14</ref></char>)</para>
  <para style="ib" />
  <para style="ie" />
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2CO 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 1:1" />Me Paul bɔ Nyameɛ adaworoma nde Kristo Yesu somafoɛ, mene yɛliema Timoteo, yɛfa krataa he yɛbrɛ Nyameɛ asafo bɔ ɔwɔ Korinto ne, ɔne Akrongronfoɛ bɔ bɛwɔ Akaia nekaa biala ne.<verse eid="2CO 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 1:2" />Adom ne asomdwie bɔ ofi yɛ Baba Nyameɛ ne y'Awurade Yesu Kristo berɛ ha ɛmɔ.<verse eid="2CO 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 1:3" />Ayɛyie ha Nyameɛ, y'Awurade Yesu Kristo Baba ne, anwunvoinwunɛ Baba ɔne awerɛkyekye mukoraati Nyameɛ ne, <verse eid="2CO 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 1:4" />ye yeɛ ɔkyekye yɛ wora wɔ amaneɛ bɔ yɛnwu ye namukoraati nu, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a yɛ koso, awerɛkyekye bɔ yanya yafi Nyameɛ berɛ nati, yɛkɔhora yɛkɔkyekye bɛ bɔ bɛnwu amaneɛ ne wora. <verse eid="2CO 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 1:5" />Na kyɛbɔ Kristo ti, amaneɛ bɔ ɔto yɛ ne sone ne, sɔ ala ye Kristo ti yɛ awerɛkyekye sone ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 1:6" />Na sɛ yɛnwu amaneɛ a, ɛmɔ awerɛkyekye ne ngoa bɔ ɛmɔ konya ye ne ti ɔ; na sɛ bɛkyekye yɛ wora a, ɛmɔ awerɛkyekye ti ɔ, ɛhene yeɛ ɔboka ɛmɔ maa ɛmɔkora begyina ɔhaw bɔ yɛ koso yɛyia bie ne noa ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 1:7" />Na anidasoɛ bɔ yele ye wɔ ɛmɔ nu né gyi berɛ pindinn, ofikyɛ yɛse kyɛ, ɔnate kyɛ ɛmɔnwu y'amaneɛ ne bie nati, awerɛkyekye bɔ yanya ye ne, ɛmɔ konya bie.<verse eid="2CO 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 1:8" />Aliemaa mɔ, amaneɛ bɔ yɛnwuni ye wɔ Asia mandanu dɔ ne, yɛmbena kyɛ yɛfa yɛfea ɛmɔ. Ɔhaw bɔ yɛhɔle nu ne, né ɔbo y'anwoserɛ so, né yɛse kyɛ yɛ ngoa po kofi yɛ sa. <verse eid="2CO 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 1:9" />Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, né yɛse kyɛ yawu yayie. Nakoso ɛhe bokale yɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a yɛngɔfa yɛ nwo yɛngɔto yɛ nwo so, na mmom yɛkɔfa yɛkɔto Nyameɛ bɔ otingye awufo naso. <verse eid="2CO 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 1:10" />Ɔhale kaa bie ahaa yɛwu, nakoso ɔlɛle ye, na okosa kole yɛ. Na yɛle ahotɔsoɛ wɔ ye nu kyɛ, ɔkɔhɔ so kole yɛ, <verse eid="2CO 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 1:11" />mmerɛ bɔ ɛmɔboka yɛ wɔ mbaebɔ nu ne. Ɛhene kɔmaa mmeni pee kɔla ase kɔma yɛ wɔ adom bɔ mmeni pee mbaeɛ ti, bafa balo yɛ nanwo.<verse eid="2CO 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 1:12" />Ɛhe ati yeɛ yɛhoɔhoa yɛ nwo ne, yɛ ahonim di yɛ adanzeɛ kyɛ yɛfale nahorɛlilɛ ne nyamesuro yɛbɔle yɛ bra wɔ wiase nanu, ɛnga-nga mmerɛ bɔ ne yɛwɔ ɛmɔ berɛ ne. Nná sona nyanza yeɛ yɛfa yɛbɔle yɛ bra ɔ, mmom adom bɔ ofi Nyameɛ berɛ. <verse eid="2CO 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 1:13" />Na bɔ yɛtworɔ yɛbrɛ ɛmɔ ne, ɔtte nikye bɔ ɛmɔngora ye kenga anaa ɛmɔnde yebo ɔ. Medɛ́ medi kyɛ ɛmɔ kɔte ɛhemɔ bo yé paa, <verse eid="2CO 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 1:14" />kyɛbɔ ɛmɔ ate yɛ bo kaa kyɛ, ɛmɔ kɔhora bɛkɔfa yɛ bɛkɔhoɔhoa ɛmɔ nwo ne, sɔ ala yeɛ ɛmɔ koso, Awurade Yesu kyẽa ne, yɛkɔfa ɛmɔ yɛkɔ-hoɔhoa yɛ nwo.<verse eid="2CO 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 1:15" />Sɔ ahotɔsoɛ he ati, nyɛle m'adwene kyɛ ahaa ngosa ngɔwa ɛmɔ berɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ɛmɔ nye kɔgye bieku ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 1:16" />Yeti nyɛle kyɛ, sɛ me kɔ Makedonia a, ngɔfa ɛmɔ berɛ, na sɛ mvi Makedonia meba a, ngosa ngɔfa ɛmɔ berɛ, na yesi ne ɛmɔ asoma me atee maa mahɔ Yudea. <verse eid="2CO 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 1:17" />Mmɔle me ti anu sɔ ne, aso né m'adwene nzi me pi hɔ? Anaa nyane sɔ adwene ne wɔ anwoɔnaen nu, ma yeti sɛ meka “Yoo” a, né masesa me noa maha “Daabi”? <verse eid="2CO 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 1:18" />Nyameɛ de, ɔte ebie bɔ odi nahorɛ, yeti yɛnga “Yoo” yɛngyire ɛmɔ, né yasa yaha “Daabi.” <verse eid="2CO 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 1:19" />Ofikyɛ Nyameɛ awa Yesu Kristo bɔ mene Silas<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ye ala yeɛ ole Silwano.</char></note> ne Timoteo hane ye nwo dwirɛ hyirele ɛmɔ ne, ɔtte ebie bɔ ɔka “Yoo” a, okyire “daabi” ɔ, mmom ye de, ɔka “Yoo” a, ɔte “Yoo.” <verse eid="2CO 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 1:20" />Na ɔnate ye so yeɛ Nyameɛ bɔhyɛ mukoraati ayɛ “Yoo.” Yeti yeɛ yɛnate ye so yɛka “Amen” yɛkyire Nyameɛ yɛfa yɛhyɛ Nyameɛ anuonyam. <verse eid="2CO 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 1:21" />Na Nyameɛ yeɛ wasi ye pi kyɛ, yɛne ɛmɔ mukoraati te Kristo deɛ, na ye yeɛ wasra yɛ ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 1:22" />Wahyɛ yɛ nzorɛ, na wafa ye honhom ne wama yɛ wɔ y'ahone nu wafa wali ɛhe anwo agyinam.<verse eid="2CO 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 1:23" />Na Nyameɛ yeɛ ɔte me adanzeniɛ kyɛ, membena kyɛ ɛmɔ wora bɔ, yeti yeɛ mmmale Korinto ne. <verse eid="2CO 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 1:24" />Yɛtte atumvoɛ wɔ ɛmɔ gyidie so, mmom yɛte mmenia bɔ yɛne ɛmɔ yɛ adwuma maa ɛmɔ nye gye, ofikyɛ ɛmɔ gyidie yeɛ wamaa ɛmɔ agyina pindinn.<verse eid="2CO 1:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2CO 2" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 2:1" />Na mayɛ m'adwene kyɛ, mengɔwa ɛmɔ berɛ ma ɛmɔ wora ngɔbɔ kõ. <verse eid="2CO 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 2:2" />Ofikyɛ sɛ me maa ɛmɔ wora bɔ a, nwa bieku yeɛ ɔkɔmaa me nye kɔha ɔ? Nná ɛmɔ bɔ mamaa ɛmɔ wora abɔ nala? <verse eid="2CO 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 2:3" />Ɛhene ati yeɛ ndworɔle krataa hene ne, kyɛbɔ meba a, mmenia bɔ odikyɛ medi bɛ nwo ahurusi ne, bɛngɔma me wora ngɔbɔ ɔ. Ná nne gyidie kyɛ, bɔ ɔmaa me nye gye ne, ɛhene ala yeɛ ɔmaa ɛmɔ koso ɛmɔ nye gye ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 2:4" />Ofikyɛ nne ahometrɛ, ahone nu yealɛ, ne ɛmoen yeɛ ndworɔle krataa ne mmerɛle ɛmɔ ɔ. Nná kyɛ mepena kyɛ ɛmɔ wora bɔ, na mmom mepena kyɛ ɛmɔnwu ɔdɔ bɔ nne ye mma ɛmɔ ne.<verse eid="2CO 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 2:5" />Na sɛ ebie ama aworaborɛ awa a, nná me ngome yeɛ wamaa me wora abɔ ɔ, atee bie so ne, ɛmɔ mukoraati. Menguro kyɛ mesɛkye edwirɛ ne koraa. <verse eid="2CO 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 2:6" />Sɔ sona ne de, asotwe<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Nga anim.”</char></note> bɔ mmeni dodoɔ ne afa ama ye ne te pa, <verse eid="2CO 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 2:7" />yeti, ɛmɔfa bɛhyɛ ye, na ɛmɔkyekye ye wora, wanyɛ sɔ a, aworaborɛ kohu ye.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:7 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Aworaborɛ kɔhyɛ ye so.”</char></note> <verse eid="2CO 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 2:8" />Yeti mesrɛ ɛmɔ, ɛmɔma onwu ye kyɛ ɛmɔdɔ ye. <verse eid="2CO 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 2:9" />Na ɛhe ati yeɛ ndworɔle krataa ne mmerɛle ɛmɔ ne, né mepena kyɛ menwu kyɛ, sɛ ɛmɔyɛ sotie wɔ nikye biala nu a. <verse eid="2CO 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 2:10" />Na ebiala bɔ ɛmɔ kɔfa bɛkɔhyɛ ye ne, me koso mafa mahyɛ ye. Na nikye biala bɔ mafa mahyɛ ne, (sɛ mafa mahyɛ a), ɛmɔ ti yeɛ mafa mahyɛ wɔ Kristo nyunu ne, <verse eid="2CO 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 2:11" />kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, Abɔnzam ngonya yɛ, ofikyɛ yɛse ye atee nemɔ.<verse eid="2CO 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 2:12" />Mmerɛ bɔ ngɔle Troa kyɛ mekwaaha Kristo nwo nzɛmba ne, atee bie bukye mane me wɔ Awurade nu. <verse eid="2CO 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 2:13" />Nakoso né me nwo ndɔ me, ofikyɛ mannwu nniema Tito wɔ berɛ. Yeti mene bɛ lili ngraa, yeɛ ngɔle Makedonia ɔ.<verse eid="2CO 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 2:14" />Nakoso asennaa ha Nyameɛ, ye yeɛ daa odi yɛ nyunu maa yɛne Kristo to sanden wɔ ngunim nu, na ɔnate yɛ so amaa ye nimdeɛ nanwo pambaen ne awuro-wura nekaa biala. <verse eid="2CO 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 2:15" />Na Nyameɛ nyunu de, yɛte Kristo nwo pambaen ma bɛ bɔ bedɛ bɛ ngoa, ɔne bɛ bɔ bɛsɛkye ne. <verse eid="2CO 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 2:16" />Bɛ bɔ bɛsɛkye ne de, yɛte pambaen bɔ ofi ewue nu ɔkɔ ewue nu; na bɛ bɔ bedɛ bɛ ngoa ne de, yɛte pambaen bɔ ofi ngoa nu ɔkɔ ngoa nu. Na nwa yeɛ adwuma he fata ye ɔ? <verse eid="2CO 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 2:17" />Yɛ, ofikyɛ yɛ de, yɛndɔne Nyameɛ dwirɛ ne, kyɛbɔ mmeni pee yɛ ne, mmom yɛfi y'ahone nu yɛdwudwo wɔ Kristo nu kyɛ mmenia bɔ Nyameɛ asoma bɛ, wɔ Nyameɛ nyunu.<verse eid="2CO 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2CO 3" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 3:1" />Bekye bɔ yɛhyɛ yebo yɛkamvo yɛ nwo yɛkyire bieku anaa? Anaa kyɛbɔ ebiemɔ yɛ ne, odikyɛ yɛfa krataa bɔ odi yɛ nwo adanzeɛ yɛbakyire ɛmɔ, anaa yedɛ bie yɛfi ɛmɔ berɛ hɔ? <verse eid="2CO 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 3:2" />Ɛmɔ yeɛ ɛmɔte yɛ krataa bɔ bahworɔ ye wɔ y'ahone so, bɔ ebiala nwu ye, ná ɔkenga ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 3:3" />Na nikye biala kyire kyɛ ɛmɔte Kristo krataa, na yɛ yeɛ yɛte asomvoɛ bɔ yɛ hworɔle ɔ, ɛhe de nná pɛn yeɛ bɛfa bɛhworɔle ɔ, mmom Nyameɛ bɔ ɔte ase ne honhom. Bandworɔ ye wɔ nyɔboɛ so, mmom bɛhworɔle ye wɔ anwoɔnaen so, ahone so.<verse eid="2CO 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 3:4" />Sɔ ahotɔsoɛ ne yeɛ yɛnate Kristo so anya ye wɔ Nyameɛ nu ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 3:5" />Nná bɔ yɛka yeɛ ole kyɛ, yɛ mmɔdemmɔ yeɛ wamaa yafata kyɛ yɛyɛ nikye<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:5 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Adwuma.”</char></note> bie ɔ, mmom Nyameɛ yeɛ ɔmaa yɛfata ɔ, <verse eid="2CO 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 3:6" />ye yeɛ wamaa yafata paa kyɛ yɛyɛ apam foforɛ nanwo asomvoɛ. Yɛtte mmeraa bɔ bahworɔ nanwo asomvoɛ, mmom yɛte honhom ne deɛ, ofikyɛ mmeraa bɔ bahworɔ ne fa sona kɔ ewue nu, nakoso honhom ne de, ɔma ngoa.<verse eid="2CO 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 3:7" />Mmeraa bɔ ɔfa ewue ba, bɔ bɛhworɔ bɛguale nyɔboɛ so ne wale wɔ anuonyam nu, na ye anuonyam nati Israel mmaa nemɔ angora annea Mose nyunu. Ná sɛ né sɔ anuonyam ne kɔpɛ nu a, <verse eid="2CO 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 3:8" />nzuati yeɛ honhom bɔ bɛfa bɛma né anuonyam ne ngɔsone ngɔtra ɛhene ɔ? <verse eid="2CO 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 3:9" />Na sɛ mmeraa bɔ obu kumfɔ ne le anuonyam a, ye de bɔ ɔfa tenenee ba ne konya anuonyam bɔ ɔtra sɔ koraa. <verse eid="2CO 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 3:10" />Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, bɔ mmerɛ bie ne ole anuonyam ne po, baye ye anuonyam ne bafi berɛ, ɔnate anuonyam bɔ ɔbo ye deɛ naso nati. <verse eid="2CO 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 3:11" />Sɛ bɔ né ɔkɔpɛ nu ne le anuonyam a, ye de, bɔ ɔkɔtena berɛ daa ne anuonyam ne kɔbo so koraa.<verse eid="2CO 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 3:12" />Ɔnate kyɛ yɛle sɔ anidasoɛ nati, yɛfa akukuduro yɛdwudwo, <verse eid="2CO 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 3:13" />na yɛtte kyɛ Mose bɔ ɔfale nikye katale ye nyunu, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a Israel mmaa nemɔ ngonwu bɔ ɔkɔpɛ nu né awieɛ ne. <verse eid="2CO 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 3:14" />Mmom b'adwene wuli,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Bɛ ti wuli.”</char></note> na ɛnɛ ne ɛnɛ po, sɛ bɛkenga apam daa ne a, sɔ nikye ne tɛ́ kata bɛ nyunu, ofikyɛ Kristo ngome yeɛ ɔkɔhora kɔye kofi berɛ ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 3:15" />Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, ɔbaadwu ɛnɛ, sɛ bɛkenga Mose dwirɛ ne a, sɔ nikye ne tɛ́ kata b'ahone so. <verse eid="2CO 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 3:16" />Nakoso sɛ ebie kakyi ye nwo ba Awurade berɛ a, Awurade ye sɔ nikye bɔ ɔkata ye nyunu ne fi berɛ. <verse eid="2CO 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 3:17" />Awurade yeɛ ɔte honhom ne, na nekaa biala bɔ Awurade honhom wɔ ne, ahofadie wɔ berɛ. <verse eid="2CO 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 3:18" />Yeti yɛ mukoraati, mmerɛ bɔ yɛfa yɛ nyunu bɔ yɛkatalle ne yɛda Awurade anuonyam ali kyɛ ahwehwɛ ne, né yɛsesa yɛkɔ suban kõ nala nu fi anuonyam kõ nu kɔ anuonyam bɔ ɔtra sɔ nu, kyɛbɔ Awurade bɔ ɔte honhom ne yɛ ye pɛpɛɛpɛ ne.<verse eid="2CO 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2CO 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 4:1" />Na ɔnate kyɛ Nyameɛ anwu yɛ anwunvo afa ɔsom adwuma he awura yɛ sa nati, yɛmba aba. <verse eid="2CO 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 4:2" />Mmom yahwe yɛ nwo yafi nningyein bɔ ɔyɛ fɛle bɔ bɛyɛ ye awosii nu nanwo; yɛmva nnaka-naka yɛmmɔ yɛ bra, na yɛmvra Nyameɛ dwirɛ nanu koso. Mmom yɛda nahorɛ ne ali, na yɛnate so yɛdi yɛ nwo adanzeɛ yɛkyire ebiala wɔ Nyameɛ nyunu. <verse eid="2CO 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 4:3" />Sɛ ɔte nahorɛ kyɛ nzɛmba bɔ yɛka naso akata a, so akata ama bɛ bɔ bɛsɛkye ne. <verse eid="2CO 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 4:4" />Bɛ nu yeɛ wiase he nyameɛ né asi bɛ bɔ benne benni ne adwene nye, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a Kristo bɔ ɔte Nyameɛ sɛso<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Suban.”</char></note> né anuonyam nzɛmba nanwo kanea ne ngɔta bɛ so. <verse eid="2CO 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 4:5" />Nná yɛ nwo dwirɛ yeɛ yɛka ɔ, mmom yɛka Yesu Kristo nwo dwirɛ kyɛ ɔte Awurade, na yɛ koso Yesu ti, yɛte ɛmɔ ngoaa. <verse eid="2CO 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 4:6" />Ofikyɛ Nyameɛ bɔ ɔhane kyɛ, “Kanea fí awosii nanu ta” ne, ye yeɛ wamaa kanea atɔ y'ahone so, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a Nyameɛ anuonyam nimdeɛ ne kɔta y'ahone so wɔ Kristo Yesu nyunu.<verse eid="2CO 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 4:7" />Nakoso yanya sɔ agyapadeɛ he wɔ nningyein bɔ bafa nnɛterɛ banwo nu, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, tumi bɔ ɔbo sona deɛ so ne kɔyɛ Nyameɛ deɛ, na ɔtte yɛ deɛ. <verse eid="2CO 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 4:8" />Bɛmia yɛ paa wɔ nikye biala nu, nakoso ɔtte kyɛ yɛngora yɛ nwo kakyi koraa, y'adwene atu afra, nakoso ɔtte kyɛ yɛnya yɛ nwo yɛndete, <verse eid="2CO 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 4:9" />bɛtane yɛ nye, nakoso bɛ polle yɛ, babɔ yɛ bato ase, nakoso bɛsɛkyelle yɛ. <verse eid="2CO 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 4:10" />Ewue nwo amaneɛ bɔ Yesu nwuni ye ne, daa yɛnwu bie wɔ yɛ nipadua nu, ná wamaa bala ngoa bɔ Yesu le ye ne bie ali wɔ yɛ nipadua nu. <verse eid="2CO 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 4:11" />Ofikyɛ mmerɛ bɔ yɛte ase ye de, Yesu ti, daa biala yɛne ewue bɔ mbu-ne-mbu, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a Yesu ngoa ne koso kɔla ali wɔ yɛ nwonaen bɔ owu nanu. <verse eid="2CO 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 4:12" />Yeti, ewue yɛ adwuma wɔ yɛ nu, na ɛmɔ de ngoa yɛ adwuma wɔ ɛmɔ nu.<verse eid="2CO 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 4:13" />Bahworɔ kyɛ: “Nne nnili, yeti medwudwo;” ɔnate kyɛ yɛle sɔ gyidie honhom ne bie nati, yɛ koso yedɛ yɛdi, yeti yɛdwudwo. <verse eid="2CO 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 4:14" />Ofikyɛ bɔ otingyele Awurade Yesu ne, yɛse kyɛ okotingye yɛ koso kɔboka Yesu so, na ɔkɔye yɛ ne ɛmɔ mukoraati kohyire. <verse eid="2CO 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 4:15" />Ɛmɔ ti yeɛ ɛhemɔ mukoraati kɔ so ne, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, adom ne bɔ wabu wabɔ ye nwo ne kɔhɔ so kɔbo so, ofikyɛ mmeni pee yeɛ bɛhyɛ Nyameɛ anuonyam ɔ.<verse eid="2CO 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 4:16" />Yeti, yɛmma y'abanu mmu. Sɛ kyɛbɔ yɛte wɔ anyeɛ so ne sɛkye po a, kyɛbɔ yɛte wɔ yɛ nu ne de, daa biala ɔyɛ foforɛ. <verse eid="2CO 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 4:17" />Na amaneɛ bɔ yɛnwu ye kesaalae ne, ɔngɔhyɛ, ná enu yɛ nyera, nakoso anuonyam bɔ ɔfa ba ne te piri, na ɔkɔtena berɛ daa; <verse eid="2CO 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 4:18" />yeti, nná nningyein bɔ anyeɛ nwu ye, yeɛ yɛfa y'adwene yɛ sie so ɔ, mmom nningyein bɔ anyeɛ nnwu ye. Ofikyɛ nningyein bɔ anyeɛ nwu ye ne, ɔngyɛ, nakoso bɔ anyeɛ nnwu ye ne de, ɔtena berɛ daa.<verse eid="2CO 4:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2CO 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 5:1" />Na yɛse kyɛ sɛ bɛsɛkye yɛ aseɛ he aso tɛnt, bɔ ɔte y'awuro ne a, yekonya awuro yɛkofi Nyameɛ berɛ. Sɔ sua ne de, nná sona yeɛ osili ɔ, na ɔwɔ berɛ daa wɔ anwuro. <verse eid="2CO 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 5:2" />Na tɛnt bɔ yɛte nu ne de, yɛsu yɛgua yɛ nu, ofikyɛ yɛ nye aboro paa bɔ yɛpena kyɛ yɛwura yɛ deɛ bɔ ɔwɔ anwuro ne, <verse eid="2CO 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 5:3" />ofikyɛ, sɛ yɛfa ɛhene yɛwura a, yɛ nwo ngɔla so. <verse eid="2CO 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 5:4" />Bɔ ɔte yeɛ ole kyɛ, yɛ bɔ yɛte sɔ tɛnt he anu ne de, yɛsu yɛgua yɛ nu, ná nningyein hyɛ yɛ so, nná kyɛ yɛpena kyɛ bɛye bɔ owura yɛ ne oo, mmom yɛpena kyɛ yɛwura ɛhene yɛgua so, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ngoa kɔme bɔ owu ne. <verse eid="2CO 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 5:5" />Na Nyameɛ yeɛ wasiesie yɛ wama sɔ nhyehyɛɛ ne ɔ. Ye yeɛ wafa ye honhom ne wama yɛ wafa wali ɛhe anwo agyinam.<verse eid="2CO 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 5:6" />Yeti daa biala yɛle akukuduro paa, na yɛsekyɛ, mmerɛ bɔ nipadua he te y'awuro ne de, yɛnne Awurade nwo dɔ. <verse eid="2CO 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 5:7" />Ofikyɛ yɛnate gyidie nu, nná bɔ yɛ nye nwu ye nu. <verse eid="2CO 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 5:8" />Nakoso yɛle akukuduro, na yɛnyane ye a, ahaa yafi nipadua he anu yaatena Awurade nwo dɔ. <verse eid="2CO 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 5:9" />Yeti, sɛ yɛne ye yeɛ ɛte oo, sɛ yate yɛ nwo oo, bɔ ogyi yɛ nye so yeɛ ole kyɛ, yɛkɔyɛ bɔ ɔsɔ ye nye. <verse eid="2CO 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 5:10" />Yeti, odikyɛ yɛ mukoraati yɛgyina Kristo atemmuo bia ne nyunu, na bɔ ebiala yɛle mmerɛ bɔ né ɔwɔ nipadua nanu ne, pa oo, tɛɛ oo, onya ye nwo akatua.<verse eid="2CO 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 5:11" />Na ɔnate kyɛ yɛse Awurade suronyi nati, yɛne mmenia dwudwo maa bedɛ yɛ bɛdi, Nyameɛ se kyɛbɔ yɛte deinn, na medɛ́ medi kyɛ ɛmɔ ahonim koso se kyɛbɔ yɛte ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 5:12" />Nná kyɛ yesa yɛkamvo yɛ nwo yɛkyire ɛmɔ, mmom yɛmaa ɛmɔnya bɔ ɛmɔ kogyina so bɛkɔfa yɛ bɛkɔhoɔhoa ɛmɔ nwo, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a ɛmɔ konya mmuayɛ bɛkɔma mmenia bɔ bɛfa bɔ anyeɛ nwu ye bɛhoɔhoa bɛ nwo, ná ɔtte bɔ ɔwɔ ahone nu ne. <verse eid="2CO 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 5:13" />Na sɛ yabɔ laen a, yabɔ yama Nyameɛ; na sɛ yɛse nworɛ a, yɛse yɛma ɛmɔ. <verse eid="2CO 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 5:14" />Na Kristo dɔ né hyɛ yɛ, ofikyɛ yanwu ye kyɛ, sona-horɛ wu mane ebiala, yeti ebiala awu. <verse eid="2CO 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 5:15" />Owu mane ebiala, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, bɛ bɔ bɛte ase ne ngɔtena ase ngɔma bɛ nwo kõ, mmom bɛkɔtena ase bɛkɔma bɔ owu mane bɛ ne.<verse eid="2CO 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 5:16" />Yeti, ofi ɛnɛ bɔ ɔkɔ ne, yɛnze ebiala wɔ anwoɔnaen nu kõ. Sɛ ne yɛse Kristo wɔ anwoɔnaen nu a, kesaalae de, yɛnze ye sɔ kõ. <verse eid="2CO 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 5:17" />Yeti, ebiala bɔ ɔne Kristo ayɛ kõ ne, wayɛ abɔdeɛ foforɛ. Nningyein daa ne apɛ nu; ɛmɔnea, nningyein foforɛ yeɛ wawa ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 5:18" />Nikye biala fi Nyameɛ berɛ, ye yeɛ ɔnate Kristo so asiesie yɛne ye afia, na ɔsom adwuma bɔ ɔfa siesie ɔne afoforɛ afia ne, wafa wawura yɛ sa; <verse eid="2CO 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 5:19" />yeɛ ole kyɛ, Nyameɛ nate Kristo so yeɛ osiesie ɔne wiase né afia ɔ, na wabu ye nye wagua bɛ mvomsoɛ so.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:19 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɔngɔbu bɛ bɔne ngogua bɛ so kõ.” </char></note> Na yɛ, yeɛ wafa wawura yɛsa kyɛ, yɛha edwirɛ bɔ ɔfa siesie ɔne mmenia afia ne ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 5:20" />Yeti, yɛgyi Kristo gya nu wɔ aseɛ he aso, ná waayɛ kyɛ Nyameɛ nate yɛ so ɔsrɛ mmenia. Yeti, yɛgyi Kristo gya nu yɛsrɛ ɛmɔ kyɛ: Ɛmɔma bɛsiesie ɛmɔ ne Nyameɛ afia. <verse eid="2CO 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 5:21" />Ye bɔ né ɔnze bɔne ne, yɛ ti, Nyameɛ fale ye kyɛ ɔte bɔne, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, yɛkɔyɛ ateneneefoɛ wɔ Nyameɛ nyunu.<verse eid="2CO 5:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2CO 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 6:1" />Ɔnate kyɛ yɛne Nyameɛ yɛ adwuma nati, yɛsrɛ ɛmɔ, Nyameɛ adom bɔ ɛmɔ anya ye ne, nnɛmɔ maa ɔyɛ mbaen. <verse eid="2CO 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 6:2" />Ofikyɛ waha kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:2">“Mmerɛ pa nu ne, ndiele wɔ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:2">na kyẽa bɔ bedɛ ngoa ne, mmokale wɔ.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="2CO 6:2">Nea, ɛnɛ yeɛ ole mmerɛ pa ne. Nea, ɛnɛ yeɛ ole kyẽa bɔ bedɛ ngoa ne. <verse eid="2CO 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 6:3" />Yɛndo sintidua wɔ nikye biala nu, ná bannya yɛ som adwuma nanwo dwirɛ biala banga, <verse eid="2CO 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 6:4" />mmom nikye biala nu ne, yɛmaa bɛnwu yɛ kyɛ yɛte Nyameɛ asomvoɛ: Wɔ animia pee nu, amanehunu nu, ehiaa nu, ahokyere nu, <verse eid="2CO 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 6:5" />mmerɛ bɔ bɛbo yɛ, prizin nnaa nu, mmerɛ bɔ bɛyɛ yɛ basabasa, ɛfɛɛ nu, asiripɛ nu, ɛhɔen nu, <verse eid="2CO 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 6:6" />ahoteɛ nu, nimdeɛ nu, aboterɛ nu, paayɛlɛ nu, honhom krongron nu, ɔdɔ kaenn<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɔdɔ bɔ nyaatwom nne nu.”</char></note> nu, <verse eid="2CO 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 6:7" />nahorɛ dwirɛ bɔ yɛka nu, ɔne Nyameɛ tumi nu; nate tenenee akodeɛ bɔ ɔwɔ yɛ sa bɛen ne yɛ sa famaa nu, <verse eid="2CO 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 6:8" />nate anuonyam ne animguaseɛ, edwirɛ pa ne edwirɛ tɛɛ so. Bɛnwu yɛ kyɛ yɛlaka-laka mmenia, nakoso yɛka nahorɛ, <verse eid="2CO 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 6:9" />bayɛ kyɛ bɛnze yɛ, nakoso bɛse yɛ paa, bɛnwu yɛ kyɛ yawu yayie, nakoso yɛte ase; bɛnwu yɛ kyɛ mmenia bɔ bahwe bɛ so ne, nakoso, bɛhunni yɛ, <verse eid="2CO 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 6:10" />bɛnwu yɛ kyɛ yɛ wora abɔ, nakoso yɛ nye gye daa, bɛnwu yɛ kyɛ ahiafoɛ, nakoso yamaa mmeni pee anya bɛ nwo, bɛnwu yɛ kyɛ yɛlle hwee, nakoso yɛle nikye biala.<verse eid="2CO 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 6:11" />O Korintofoɛ, yaha nahorɛ bɔ ɔwɔ nu ne yahyire ɛmɔ, na yabukye y'ahone nu hoo yama ɛmɔ. <verse eid="2CO 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 6:12" />Yamaa ɛmɔ anwu ye kyɛ yɛdɔ ɛmɔ, nakoso ɛmɔ de, ɛmɔ lalle ɛmɔ dɔ ali bɛhyirelle yɛ. <verse eid="2CO 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 6:13" />Yeti, medwudwo mekyire ɛmɔ kyɛ me mmaa mɔ, ɛmɔ koso, ɛmɔ bukye ɛmɔ ahone nu hoo.<verse eid="2CO 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 6:14" />Bɛ bɔ bɛtte gyidifoɛ ne, nnɛmɔ ne bɛ twe kɔnnua kõ. Ofikyɛ abusuabɔ beni yeɛ ɔla tenenee ne amumuyɛɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Mmerato.”</char></note> afia ɔ? Na kyɛfa beni yeɛ kanea ne awosii le ye ɔ? <verse eid="2CO 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 6:15" />Afei koso, nzu yeɛ ɔwɔ Kristo ne Belial<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Beliar.”</char></note> afia ɔ? Anaa abusuabɔ beni yeɛ gyidiniɛ ne bɔ ɔtte gyidiniɛ ne lɛ ye ɔ? <verse eid="2CO 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 6:16" />Ná twakã beni yeɛ ɔwɔ Nyameɛ asɔre awuro ne bosoen<note caller="●" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">6:16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Statu.”</char></note> afia ɔ? Ofikyɛ, yɛte Nyameɛ teasefoɛ né asɔre awuro; na Nyameɛ aha kyɛ:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">“Mene bɛ kɔtena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">na mene bɛ kɔnate,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:16">ngɔyɛ bɛ Nyameɛ,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:16">ná bɛ koso, bayɛ me maen.”<verse eid="2CO 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 6:17" />“‘Yeti, ɛmɔfi bɛ nu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">na ɛmɔhwe ɛmɔ nwo,’ Awurade yeɛ waha ɔ.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 6:17">‘Nnɛmɔfa ɛmɔ sa bɛka nikye biala bɔ ye nwo nde,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:17">na ngole ɛmɔ.’”<verse eid="2CO 6:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 6:18" />“‘Na ngɔyɛ ɛmɔ Baba,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:18">na ɛmɔ koso, ɛmɔ ayɛ me mmaa mmrienzua ne me mmaa mmrasua,’</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 6:18">Awurade, bɔ ole Tumi wɔ nikye biala so ne yeɛ waha ɔ.”<verse eid="2CO 6:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2CO 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 7:1" />Aliemaa mɔ, ɔnate kyɛ yanya sɔ bɔhyɛ hemɔ nati, ɛmɔma yɛnwunzi yɛ nwo yɛfi anwoɔnaen ne honhom nu fiɛ biala nwo, na wamaa yɛ ahoteɛ ali mu wɔ Nyameɛ suronyi nu.<verse eid="2CO 7:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 7:2" />Ɛmɔ bukye ɛmɔ ahone nu bɛma yɛ. Yɛyɛlle ebiala bɔne, yɛsɛkyelle ebiala, na yɛbulli ebiala yɛfalle so.<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Yɛdidilli ebiala nwo”</char></note> <verse eid="2CO 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 7:3" />Nná kyɛ meka ɛhe mefa mebu ɛmɔ fɔ, ofikyɛ mali moa maha ye dada kyɛ, ɛmɔla y'ahone so, na ewue nu oo, ngoa nu oo, yɛne ɛmɔ ala. <verse eid="2CO 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 7:4" />Mekora mefa akukuduro medwudwo mekyire ɛmɔ. Mefa ɛmɔ mehoɔhoa me nwo paa. M'ahone atɔ me kunu paa, ɔwɔ nu kyɛ yɛnwu amaneɛ, nakoso me nye agye abo so.<verse eid="2CO 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 7:5" />Na mmerɛ bɔ yɛwale Makedonia ne, yannya ahotɔ wɔ yɛ nwonaen nu koraa, nekaa biala bɔ yɛkɔfa ne, né yɛnwu amaneɛ; né ngondii apɛ yɛ nwo ayia, na yɛ nu koso, né esuronyi aha yɛ. <verse eid="2CO 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 7:6" />Nakoso, Nyameɛ bɔ ɔkyekye bɛ bɔ b'ahone abubu<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “B'abanu abu.”</char></note> ne wora ne, ɔnate Tito bɔ ɔwale naso kyekyele yɛ wora, <verse eid="2CO 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 7:7" />nná ɛwalɛ bɔ ɔwale ne ngome yeɛ ɔkyekyele yɛ wora ɔ, mmom awerɛkyekye bɔ ɛmɔ ti onyane ye ne ti ɔ. Ofikyɛ ɔwale ne, ɔmaa yɛnwuni kyɛ ɛmɔ afe me, ɛmɔ wora abɔ paa, na ɛmɔdwene me nwo, ɛhene maa me nye gyele paa. <verse eid="2CO 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 7:8" />Na sɛ me krataa ne maa ɛmɔ wora bɔle po a, nnnuni me nwo. Sɛ ahyɛaseɛ ne, nnuni me nwo po a (ofikyɛ nwuni kyɛ krataa ne maa ɛmɔ wora bɔle mmerɛ kaa bie), <verse eid="2CO 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 7:9" />kesaalae de me nye agye, nakoso nná ɛmɔ wora bɔ ɔbɔle nati yeɛ wamaa me nye agye ɔ, mmom aworaborɛ ne maa ɛmɔ sakrale ɛmɔ adwene, ofikyɛ ɛmɔ aworaborɛ ne, né ɔte bɔ Nyameɛ kuro ɔ, na yamma nikye tɛɛ biala ando ɛmɔ. <verse eid="2CO 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 7:10" />Sɛ Nyameɛ ti, ebie wora bɔ a, ɔmaa ɔsakra ye adwene nya ngoa, na ɔnyɛ ye yea kyɛ ɔsakrale y'adwene ɔ. Nakoso wiase nanu aworaborɛ de, ɔfa ewue ba. <verse eid="2CO 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 7:11" />Ɛmɔ wora bɔ ɔbɔle, ɔnate kyɛ né ɛmɔpena kyɛ ɛmɔyɛ bɔ Nyameɛ kuro nati, ɛmɔnea nikye pa bɔ wafi nu wawa ɔ: Ɔyele bɔ ne ɔla ɛmɔ so ne fili berɛ, ɔmaa ɛmɔ fɛle yaa, esuronyi hane ɛmɔ, ɛmɔ fele yɛ, ɛmɔ bɔle ɛmɔ nwo mmɔden, osiesiele mvomsoɛ ne. Na nikye biala nu, ɛmɔ ahyire kyɛ edwirɛ biala nne ɛmɔ nwo wɔ edwirɛ he nu. <verse eid="2CO 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 7:12" />Ɔwɔ nu kyɛ ndworɔle krataa mmerɛle ɛmɔ, nakoso nná bɔ ɔyɛle bɔne nati yeɛ ndworɔle ɔ, yeɛ mandworɔ mammerɛ bɔ bɛyɛle ye bɔne ne, mmom kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a mmɔden bɔ ɛmɔbɔ wɔ yɛ nwo ne kɔla ali wɔ ɛmɔ nu, wɔ Nyameɛ nyunu. <verse eid="2CO 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 7:13" />Ɛhene ati yeɛ yɛ wora akyekye ne.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 7:13">Nakoso, nná ɛhene angome, mmom anigye bɔ Tito anya ye ne, wamaa yɛ koso yɛ nye agye paa, ofikyɛ ɛmɔ mukoraati, ɛmɔ maa ye ahone tɔle ye kunu. <verse eid="2CO 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 7:14" />Na sɛ mvale ɛmɔ nhoɔhoale me nwo ngyirele ye a, ɛmɔ amma me nyunu angua ase. Na kyɛbɔ edwirɛ biala bɔ yɛha yɛhyirele ɛmɔ ne te nahorɛ ne, sɔ ala yeɛ ɛmɔ bɔ yɛfale ɛmɔ yɛhoɔhoale yɛ nwo yɛhyirele Tito ne koso ayɛ nahorɛ ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 7:15" />Na sɛ ɔkaye sotie bɔ ɛmɔ mukoraati ɛmɔ yɛle, ɔne kyɛbɔ ɛmɔ fale esuronyi ne ahopopo bɛlɛle ye kama ne a, ɔmaa ɔdɔ bɔ ole ye ma ɛmɔ ne yɛ piri. <verse eid="2CO 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 7:16" />Me nye agye paa, ofikyɛ nikye biala nu ne, nne gyidie wɔ ɛmɔ nu.<verse eid="2CO 7:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2CO 8" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 8:1" />Afei aliemaa mɔ, yɛpena kyɛ ɛmɔnwu adom bɔ Nyameɛ afa alo asafo ahoroɛ bɔ ɔwɔ Makedonia ne. <verse eid="2CO 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 8:2" />Amaneɛ nwora bɔ bɛnwu ye wɔ nzɔhwɛ pirikua he anu, bɛ anigye mmorosoɛ, ɔne bɛ hiaa buburoo ne amaa bɛ adɔyɛ ne abo so. <verse eid="2CO 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 8:3" />Ofikyɛ bɛyɛle bɔ bɛkɔhora biala, na medi bɛ nwo adanzeɛ kyɛ bɛyɛle bɔ ɔbo bɛ anwoserɛ so po, <verse eid="2CO 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 8:4" />ofikyɛ bɛsrɛle yɛ alaa kyɛ yɛma bɛ atee ma bɛfa bɔ bɛle ye ne bɛbra, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, adwuma<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8:4 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɔsom adwuma.”</char></note> bɔ yɛyɛ yɛfa yɛboka akrongronfoɛ bɔ bɛ nwo ahyere bɛ ne, bɛ konya ye nwo atee bɛkɔyɛ bie. <verse eid="2CO 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 8:5" />Bɔ ne yɛnea atee ne po de, bɛyɛle maa ɔtrale sɔ, ofikyɛ Nyameɛ pɛ ti, bɛli moa bɛfale bɛ nwo bɛmane Awurade, afei bɛfale bɛ nwo bɛmane yɛ. <verse eid="2CO 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 8:6" />Yeti, yasrɛ Tito kyɛ adwuma bɔ ɔhyɛle yebo wɔ ɛmɔ nu ne, ɔɔtoa so, na odidɛ bɔ ɛmɔfi ɛmɔ ahone nu ɛmɔfa bɛma ne. <verse eid="2CO 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 8:7" />Afei koso, nikye biala abu ɛmɔ so: gyidie, dwudwolɛ, nimdeɛ, mmɔdemmɔ, ne ɔdɔ bɔ yɛdɔ ɛmɔ ne. Yeti bɔ ɛmɔfi ɛmɔ ahone nu bɛfa bɛma ne, ɛmɔyɛ ma ɔbo so. <verse eid="2CO 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 8:8" />Ɔtte kyɛ mehyɛ ɛmɔ, mmom mepena kyɛ ɛmɔnwu mmɔden bɔ ebiemɔ bɔ ne, né wamaa manwu ɔdɔ kaenn bɔ ɛmɔle ye ne. <verse eid="2CO 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 8:9" />Nnaa ɛmɔse adom bɔ ne y'Awurade Yesu Kristo le ye ne. Ɔwɔ nu kyɛ ne wanya ye nwo, nakoso ɛmɔ ti ɔɔyɛle hianiɛ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ɛmɔ nate ye hiaa naso konya ɛmɔ nwo. <verse eid="2CO 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 8:10" />M'adwene bɔ mekyire ye wɔ ɛhe anwo yeɛ ole kyɛ: Sɛ ɛmɔyɛ bɔ meka ne a, ɔkɔboka ɛmɔ. Ofikyɛ afoɛ hene yeɛ ɛmɔ hyɛle yebo kyɛ ɛmɔyɛ ɛhe, na ne ɛmɔ nye aboro paa kyɛ ɛmɔ kɔyɛ. <verse eid="2CO 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 8:11" />Yeti kesaalae, ɛmɔyie bɔ ɛmɔ hyɛle yebo ne. Na kyɛbɔ ne ɛmɔ nye aboro kyɛ ɛmɔ kɔyɛ ne, ɛmɔnea bɔ ɛmɔle ye naso, na ɛmɔfa sɔ ahokeka ne bɛyie. <verse eid="2CO 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 8:12" />Ofikyɛ sɛ ebie le ɔpɛ kyɛ ɔkɔboka a, bɔ ole ye ne yeɛ ɔsɔ anyeɛ ɔ, na ɔtte bɔ olle ye ne. <verse eid="2CO 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 8:13" />Ɔtte kyɛ mepena kyɛ ɔyɛ mmerɛ ma ebiemɔ, na ɛmɔ de ɔyɛ se ma ɛmɔ, mmom mepena kyɛ nikye biala kyɛ pɛpɛɛpɛ, <verse eid="2CO 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 8:14" />na bɔ wabo ɛmɔ so kesaalae ne amaa banya bɔ behia ɔ, na bɔ wabo bɛ so ne amaa ɛmɔ anya bɔ ɛmɔ hia ɔ, na nikye biala ahyɛ pɛpɛɛpɛ. <verse eid="2CO 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 8:15" />Ofikyɛ, kyɛbɔ bahworɔ ne:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 8:15">“Bɔ ɔsesale pee ne, ye deɛ ne ammo so,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 8:15">na bɔ ɔsesale kaa ne, ye deɛ ne anyɛ kaa soma.”<verse eid="2CO 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 8:16" />Yɛda Nyameɛ ase paa kyɛ wafa wawura Tito ahone nu kyɛ ɔdwene ɛmɔ nwo, kyɛbɔ yɛdwene ɛmɔ nwo nala, <verse eid="2CO 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 8:17" />ofikyɛ adesrɛdeɛ bɔ yɛfa yɛtole ye nyunu ne, wale wato nu. Na ɔnate kyɛ ye nye gye ye nwo kyɛ ɔkɔyɛ nati, ye bɔbɔ yenwa ɔba ɛmɔ berɛ. <verse eid="2CO 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 8:18" />Nakoso yɛsoma aliemaa bɔ nzɛmba nati, asafo namukoraati kamvo ye ne maa ɔne ye ba. <verse eid="2CO 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 8:19" />Nná ɛhene angome, mmom asafo ahoroɛ ne aye ye kyɛ ɔboka yɛ so, mmerɛ bɔ yɛfa sɔ akyɛdeɛ he yɛkɔ nekaa ahoroɛ yɛfa yɛhyɛ Awurade anuonyam, na yɛfa yɛkyire kyɛ yɛpena kyɛ yɛboka ne. <verse eid="2CO 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 8:20" />Kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, ɛhe nngɔma ebiala ngɔkeka ye nwo dwirɛ tɛɛ, mmerɛ bɔ yɛkyekyɛ nningyein bɔ bafia bɛ kunu bafa bawa ne. <verse eid="2CO 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 8:21" />Na yɛbɔ mmɔden kyɛ yɛkɔyɛ nikye biala pɛpɛɛpɛ, nná Awurade nyunu ngome, mmom kuro sona koso nyunu.<verse eid="2CO 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 8:22" />Yesa yɛsoma yɛliema kõ yɛboka bɛ so. Ye de, yasɔ ye yanea, na yanwu ye kyɛ ɔbɔ mmɔden wɔ nningyein pee nu, na kesaalae po de, ɔnate ahotɔsoɛ bɔ wanya ye wɔ ɛmɔ nu nati, ye mmɔdemmɔ ne ayɛ piri paa. <verse eid="2CO 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 8:23" />Sɛ ɛmɔpena kyɛ ɛmɔnwu Tito nwo dwirɛ pee a, ɔboka me so, na mene ye yeɛ yɛyɛ adwuma yɛboka ɛmɔ ɔ, na yɛliema nemɔ koso, bɛte asafo ahoroɛ nemɔ asomafoɛ, ɔne Kristo anuonyam. <verse eid="2CO 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 8:24" />Yeti ɛmɔla ɔdɔ ali behyire bɛ, na ɛmɔma asafo nemɔ nwu bɔ yeti yeɛ yɛfale ɛmɔ yɛhoɔhoale yɛ nwo ne.<verse eid="2CO 8:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2CO 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 9:1" />Na adwuma<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɔsom adwuma.”</char></note> bɔ yɛfa yɛboka akrongronfoɛ ne de, ye nwo nhia kyɛ metworɔ ye nwo krataa mebrɛ ɛmɔ, <verse eid="2CO 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 9:2" />ofikyɛ, mese kyɛ ɛmɔ ayɛ krado kyɛ ɛmɔ kɔboka, na mefa ɛmɔ mehoɔhoa me nwo mekyire Makedoniafoɛ ne kyɛ, afoɛ hene yeɛ Akaiafoɛ nemɔ boɔboale bɛ nwo kyɛ bɛkɔboka ɔ. Ná ɛmɔ mmɔdemmɔ ne akanyan bɛ nu pee. <verse eid="2CO 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 9:3" />Nakoso mesoma aliemaa hemɔ, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, yɛ nwo bɔ yɛfale ɛmɔ yɛhoɔhoale ne, ɔngɔyɛ mbaen, na wamaa ɛmɔ ayɛ krado kyɛ ɛmɔ kɔboka, kyɛbɔ ngane nala. <verse eid="2CO 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 9:4" />Wanyɛ sɔ, ná Makedoniafoɛ nemɔ ne me ba, na bɛ banwu kyɛ ɛmɔyɛlle ye nwo hwee a, nná yɛ ngome yeɛ yɛ nyunu kogua ase kyɛ yɛfale yɛ nwo yɛtole ɛmɔ so ɔ, ɛmɔ koso, ɛmɔ kɔfɛle paa. <verse eid="2CO 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 9:5" />Yeti, menwu ye kyɛ ye nwo hia kyɛ mesrɛ aliemaa nemɔ maa bɛdi moa bɛba ɛmɔ berɛ, ná wamaa ɛmɔ apena akyɛdeɛ bɔ ɛmɔ hyɛle ye nwo bɔ ne bato berɛ. Ɛhene kohyire kyɛ ɛmɔ bɔbɔ yeɛ ɛmɔfi ɛmɔ ahone nu bɛfa bɛma ɔ, na ɔtte kyɛ yɛhyɛ ɛmɔ.<verse eid="2CO 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 9:6" />Na odikyɛ ɛmɔnwu ye kyɛ, bɔ odua kaa bie ne kɔpɛ kaa bie,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:6 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Bɔ ɔfa pɛɛpɛɛ dua ne kɔpɛ ye pɛɛpɛɛ so.”</char></note> na bɔ odua pee ne kɔpɛ pee. <verse eid="2CO 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 9:7" />Bɔ ebiala asusu ye nwo wɔ ye ahone nu ne, ɛhene yeɛ ɔyɛ ɔ, nnɛmɔ maa ɔyɛ amemenenfi anaa ɔhyɛ, ofikyɛ bɔ ofi ye ahone nu kyɛ nikye ne yeɛ Nyameɛ kuro ye dwirɛ ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 9:8" />Afei koso, Nyameɛ kɔhora kɔmaa ye adom ne kobu ɛmɔ so, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a mmerɛ biala, ɛmɔ konya bɔ ɔkɔso ɛmɔ wɔ nikye biala nu, na ɛmɔ anya pee bafa baboka adwuma pa biala. <verse eid="2CO 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 9:9" />Na kyɛbɔ bahworɔ ne:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="2CO 9:9">“Wafia ye kunu wahyɛ nningyein,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:9 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Wahyɛ nningyein pee.”</char></note> wahyɛ ahiafoɛ nikye.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2CO 9:9">Ye tenenee wɔ berɛ afebɔɔ.”<verse eid="2CO 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 9:10" />Ye bɔ ɔmaa kuaniɛ nya mmaa dua, ná ɔma mmenia aleɛ maa bɛdi ne, ɔkɔmaa mmaa bɔ ɛmɔ dua ne kɔsone, na ɔkɔmaa ɛmɔ kɔpɛ ɛmɔ tenenee so mmaa pee. <verse eid="2CO 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 9:11" />Ɛmɔ konya ɛmɔ nwo wɔ nikye biala nu, na ɛmɔ afa bie bayɛ adɔyɛ, na ɔnate yɛ so, mmenia kɔla Nyameɛ ase. <verse eid="2CO 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 9:12" />Ná adwuma<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:12 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɔsom adwuma.”</char></note> bɔ yɛfa yɛboka mmenia ne, nná akrongronfoɛ ne ngome yeɛ wamaa banya bɔ behia ɔ, mmom ɔmaa mmenia nya nningyein pee bɔ bɛkogyina so, na bafa asennaa pee bama Nyameɛ. <verse eid="2CO 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 9:13" />Adwuma<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɔsom adwuma.”</char></note> bɔ yɛyɛ yɛboka bɛ bɔ bɛ nwo ahyere bɛ ne maa benya adanzeɛ bɛhyɛ Nyameɛ anuonyam. Ofikyɛ bɔ ɛmɔyɛ ne kyire kyɛ, ɛmɔ bɔbɔ ɛmɔfa Kristo nwo nzɛmba bɔ ɛmɔka bɛkyire mmenia ne bɛbɔ ɛmɔ bra. Nná ɛhene ngome, ɛmɔfi ɛmɔ ahone nu bɛfa ɛmɔ ndoboa bɛma bɛ ne ebiala. <verse eid="2CO 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 9:14" />Na bɛsrɛ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9:14 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Bɛbɔ mbaeɛ.”</char></note> bɛma ɛmɔ bɛfa bɛkyire kyɛ bɛkuro ɛmɔ dwirɛ, ɔnate Nyameɛ adom bɔ wabo ɛmɔ so nati. <verse eid="2CO 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 9:15" />Asennaa ha Nyameɛ wɔ ye akyɛdeɛ bɔ olle ye noa nanwo.<verse eid="2CO 9:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2CO 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 10:1" />Afei me Paul, mefa odwoɔ ne ayamye bɔ Kristo le ye ne mesrɛ ɛmɔ. Sɛ mene ɛmɔ wɔ berɛ a, nnde sona biala, nakoso sɛ nne berɛ a, me maa ɛmɔnwu ye kyɛ nne akukuduro paa. <verse eid="2CO 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 10:2" />Mesrɛ ɛmɔ, meba a, mengɔfa akukuduro mengɔwa kyɛbɔ né menea atee ne, ná wamma me nye ammoro bɛ bɔ bɛbu yɛ kyɛ yɛnate anwoɔnaen nu naso. <verse eid="2CO 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 10:3" />Ɔwɔ nu kyɛ yɛnate anwoɔnaen nu de, nakoso yɛngɔ koɛ anwoɔnaen nu. <verse eid="2CO 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 10:4" />Ofikyɛ nningyein bɔ yɛfa yɛkõ ne, ɔtte anwoɔnaen nu nningyein, nakoso Nyameɛ maa ɔyɛ se, na yɛkora yɛfa yɛtutu nningyein bɔ yebo atimu paa po yɛgua. <verse eid="2CO 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 10:5" />Ná yɛtutu nzusuyɛɛ ne nikye biala bɔ wama ye nwo so watia Nyameɛ nimdeɛ ne yɛgua, na yɛma adwene biala yɛ akoaa, ná ɔbrɛ ye nwo ase ma Kristo. <verse eid="2CO 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 10:6" />Na yayɛ krado kyɛ, ɛmɔ sotie nya di mu ala pɛ, yɛkɔhwe ebiala bɔ ɔkɔyɛ asoserɛ ne so.<verse eid="2CO 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 10:7" />Bɔ otua anyeɛ yeɛ ɛmɔnea ɔ. Sɛ ebie bu ye nwo kyɛ ɔte Kristo deɛ a, ma osa dwene sɔ nahorɛ dwirɛ he anwo: Kyɛbɔ ɔte Kristo deɛ ne, sɔ ala yeɛ yɛ koso yɛte Kristo deɛ ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 10:8" />Awurade ama yɛ tumi kyɛ yɛma ɛmɔnya ngɔsoɛ, wamma yɛ tumi kyɛ yɛbu ɛmɔ abanu; na sɛ mefa sɔ tumi ne mehoɔhoa me nwo maa ɔbo so kaa po a, ɔnyɛ me fɛle. <verse eid="2CO 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 10:9" />Na membena kyɛ ɔbayɛ kyɛ mefa me ngrataa me nwuna-nwuna ɛmɔ. <verse eid="2CO 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 10:10" />Ofikyɛ, ebiemɔ keka kyɛ: “Ye ngrataa ne de, ye noa yɛ se, na enu yɛ nno, nakoso sɛ ye bɔbɔ ɔwɔ wa a, ɔyɛ mmerɛ, na ye dwirɛ mbɛ asue.” <verse eid="2CO 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 10:11" />Odikyɛ sɔ sona ne te ye nwo bo kyɛ, bɔ yɛka ye wɔ yɛ ngrataa nanu mmerɛ bɔ yɛnne berɛ ne, yɛ ba a, ɛhene ala yeɛ yɛkɔyɛ ɔ.<verse eid="2CO 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 10:12" />Yɛmmɔ yɛ nwo mmusue kyɛ yɛfa yɛ nwo yɛboka bɛ bɔ bɛkamvo bɛ nwo naso, anaa yɛfa yɛ nwo yɛtoto bɛ nwo po. Sɛ bɛfa bɛ nwo bɛsusu bɛ mmango, na bɛfa bɛ nwo bɛtoto bɛ mmango nwo a, okyire kyɛ bɛnze nworɛ. <verse eid="2CO 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 10:13" />Na yɛ de, yɛngɔ-hoɔhoa yɛ nwo ma ɔngɔbo so, mmom yɛkɔ-hoɔhoa yɛ nwo wɔ ɛwɛen bɔ Nyameɛ asusu ama yɛ nanu, na sɔ wɛen ne, ɔbadwu ɛmɔ berɛ. <verse eid="2CO 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 10:14" />Ná yɛndwe yɛ nu ma ɔmmo so, te kyɛ ɛnwa yandwu ɛmɔ berɛ ne. Ofikyɛ yɛ yeɛ yɛli moa yɛfale Kristo nwo nzɛmba ne yɛwale alaa yɛɛdwuli ɛmɔ berɛ ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 10:15" />Ɔtte kyɛ yɛhoɔhoa yɛ nwo maa ɔbo so, ná yɛfa adwuma bɔ ebiemɔ ayɛ yɛhoɔhoa yɛ nwo. Mmom yɛle anidasoɛ kyɛ, mmerɛ bɔ ɛmɔ gyidie yɛ piri ne, bɔ yayɛ ye wɔ y'aseɛ nanu né koso kɔyɛ piri, <verse eid="2CO 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 10:16" />kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, yɛkɔha nzɛmba ne wɔ maen ahoroɛ bɔ ɔwɔ ɛmɔ si dɔ nanu, ná yamva adwuma bɔ ebie ayɛ ye dada wɔ nekaa bie ne yanhoɔhoa yɛ nwo. <verse eid="2CO 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 10:17" />“Nakoso, bɔ ɔhoɔhoa ye nwo ne, ma ɔhoɔhoa ye nwo wɔ Awurade nu.” <verse eid="2CO 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 10:18" />Ofikyɛ nná bɔ ɔkamvo ye nwo ne yeɛ ɔfata ɔ, mmom bɔ Awurade kamvo ye ne.<verse eid="2CO 10:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2CO 11" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 11:1" />Meyɛ me nikye te kyɛ ebie bɔ ɔnze nworɛ ne, nakoso mesrɛ ɛmɔ, ɛmɔte me bo. Na ɛmɔ ate me bo po dada. <verse eid="2CO 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 11:2" />Metwe ɛmɔ nwo kora te kyɛ Nyameɛ, ofikyɛ mahyɛ bɔ kyɛ ngɔfa ɛmɔ ngɔma biaa komapɛ agyaa; sɔ biaa ne yeɛ ole Kristo, na ngɔfa ɛmɔ ngɔma ye kyɛ ababunu<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Ababunu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">bɔ ɔwɔ wa ne kyire brasua bɔ ɔne brienzua lalle lle</char></note> bɔ ɛfiɛ nne ye nwo. <verse eid="2CO 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 11:3" />Nakoso mesuro kyɛ annea yé a, kyɛbɔ ɛwoo ne fale anyeteɛ laka-lakale Hawa ne, sɔ ala yeɛ ɛmɔ koso, bɛkɔsɛkye ɛmɔ adwene wɔ nahorɛ ne ahoteɛ bɔ odikyɛ ɛmɔfa bɛma Kristo nanwo. <verse eid="2CO 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 11:4" />Ofikyɛ sɛ ebie ba ɛmɔ berɛ baka Yesu foforɛ nwo dwirɛ, bɔ ɔte sorongo fi bɔ yɛhane nanwo, anaa sɛ ɛmɔnya honhom foforɛ wɔ bɔ ɛmɔli moa benyane ye ne si, anaa nzɛmba bɔ ɔte sorongo fi bɔ ɛmɔ tele nanwo a, ɛberɛ nala, né ɛmɔ alɛ́ bato nu. <verse eid="2CO 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 11:5" />Nakoso nikye biala nne berɛ bɔ sɔ asomafoɛ atitire nemɔ fa tra me ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 11:6" />Na sɛ me noa yeɛ ɔttele po a, nimdeɛ de nne bie; na yamaa ɛmɔ anwu ɛhe wɔ nikye biala nu, ne atee biala so.<verse eid="2CO 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 11:7" />Anaa me nwo bɔ mmrɛle ye ase, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a bɛkɔma ɛmɔ so ne, ɔte bɔne? Ná anigye bɔ mva ngane Nyameɛ nzɛmba ne ngyirele ɛmɔ, bɔ manne ɛmɔ hwee ne, mayɛ bɔne anaa? <verse eid="2CO 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 11:8" />Asafo biemɔ nningyein yeɛ nwiale, kyire kyɛ nnɛle, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a ngɔsõ ɛmɔ ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 11:9" />Na mmerɛ bɔ nwɔ ɛmɔ berɛ bɔ me nwo hyerele me ne, mamva me haw mando ebiala so, ofikyɛ aliemaa mɔ bɔ bɛfi Makedonia bɛwale ne, bɛfale bɔ mehia biala bɛbrɛle me. Yeti nikye biala nu, mmɔle mmɔden kyɛ mengɔfa me haw mengɔgua ɛmɔ so, na ngɔhɔ so ala ngɔyɛ sɔ. <verse eid="2CO 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 11:10" />Na mmerɛ bɔ Kristo nwo nahorɛ ne wɔ me nu ne, me nwo bɔ mehoɔhoa wɔ Akaia mandam nanu ne, mengɔyakyi ye lle. <verse eid="2CO 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 11:11" />Nzuati ɔ? Mennɔ ɛmɔ ti ahɔ anaa? Nyameɛ se kyɛ medɔ ɛmɔ!<verse eid="2CO 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 11:12" />Na ngɔhɔ so ngɔyɛ bɔ meyɛ nala, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a, bɛ bɔ bɛpena nikye bie begyina so, ná bɛne yɛ ayɛ pɛ ne, bɛngonya nikye biala bɛngɔ gyina so, ná bafa bahoɔhoa bɛ nwo. <verse eid="2CO 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 11:13" />Ofikyɛ sɔ mmenia ne te asomafoɛ ngondombofoɛ, adwumayɛfoɛ bɔ bɛnga nahorɛ, na bayɛ bɛ nwo kyɛ bɛte Kristo asomafoɛ. <verse eid="2CO 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 11:14" />Ná ɔnyɛ nwanwa, ofikyɛ Satan po kɔ so ala yɛ ye nwo kyɛ ɔte ɔbɔfo pa. <verse eid="2CO 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 11:15" />Yeti, sɛ ye asomvoɛ yɛ bɛ nwo tenenee asomvoɛ a, ɔnyɛ nwanwa. Nakoso kyɛbɔ bɛ nneyɛɛ te ne, sɔ ala yeɛ bɛ awieɛ kɔyɛ ɔ.<verse eid="2CO 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 11:16" />Meka ye bieku, nnɛmaa ebiala adwene yɛ ye kyɛ nnne adwene. Nakoso sɛ ɛmɔ adwene yɛ ɛmɔ sɔ po a, ɛmɔfa me sɔ ala, ná wamaa me koso mahoɔhoa me nwo kaa. <verse eid="2CO 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 11:17" />Bɔ meka ye kesaalae ne, nná Awurade yeɛ mesuesua ye ɔ, mmon meka ye kyɛ ebie bɔ olle adwene bɔ ɔhoɔhoa ye nwo, ná odɛ ye nwo di ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 11:18" />Ɔnate kyɛ mmeni pee hoɔhoa bɛ nwo wɔ anwoɔnaen nu nati, me koso ngɔhoɔhoa me nwo bie. <verse eid="2CO 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 11:19" />Na ɔnate kyɛ ɛmɔse nworɛ nati, ɛmɔnya bɛ bɔ bɛnze nworɛ nanwo aboterɛ. <verse eid="2CO 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 11:20" />Na ebiala bɔ ɔfa ɛmɔ yɛ ngoaa, odidi ɛmɔ nwo, osisi ɛmɔ, ɔma ye nwo so wɔ ɛmɔ so, ná ɔbɔ ɛmɔ nye so po ne, ɛmɔnya ye nwo aboterɛ. <verse eid="2CO 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 11:21" />Ɔyɛ me fɛle paa kyɛ meka ɛhe ɔ, ofikyɛ yɛ de, né yɛyɛ mmerɛ soma.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 11:21">Nakoso, sɛ bɛkora bɛfa nikye bie bɛhoɔhoa bɛ nwo a, meka ye kyɛ ebie bɔ olle adwene ne, me koso mekora mefa bie mehoɔhoa me nwo. <verse eid="2CO 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2CO 11:22" />Bɛte Hebrifoɛ anaa? Me koso sɔ ala. Bɛte Israelfoɛ? Me koso sɔ ala. Bɛte Abraham bosofoɛ? Me koso sɔ ala. <verse eid="2CO 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2CO 11:23" />Anaa bɛte Kristo asomvoɛ? Meye ye noa kyɛ ebie bɔ wabɔ laen ne, me koso nde Kristo somvoɛ paa: Mayɛ adwuma pee matra bɛ, mala prizin pee matra bɛ, bagwa me pee, na mmerɛ pee yeɛ mene ewue bɔle mbu-ne-mbu ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2CO 11:24" />Yudafoɛ agwa me pɛn nnu, na enu biala ne, ɔhale kõ, ahaa bɛgwale me 40, <verse eid="2CO 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2CO 11:25" />bafa mmakaa babo<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:25 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Baha me mbire.”</char></note> me pɛn nza, basi me nyɔboɛ kõ, matena hyep nu maa wabutu me pɛn nza, na mali ɛpo kunu eyia ne kɔngɔen le. <verse eid="2CO 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2CO 11:26" />Matu atee pee, na asane pee ato me wɔ nzue so, awiefoɛ sanu, me bɔbɔ me mmenia sanu, maen-maen nanufoɛ sanu, kuro nu, eburo, ɛpo so, aliemaa ngondombofoɛ sanu. <verse eid="2CO 11:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2CO 11:27" />Adwuma bɔ ɔyɛ se ne ɛfɛɛ, nnaa po ne menna bie, ɛhɔen ne nzuhɔen, mmerɛ pee né mennya aleɛ menni, ayirɛ huni me, na né menya atadeɛ menwura. <verse eid="2CO 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2CO 11:28" />Ɛhemɔ la ahameɛ a, daa biala, ne nikye foforɛ hyɛ me so, na ɛhene yeɛ ole asafo namukoraati nwo dadwene. <verse eid="2CO 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2CO 11:29" />Nwa yeɛ ɔyɛ mmerɛ a, me koso menyɛ mmerɛ ɔ? Nwa yeɛ bɛto ye sintidua a, ɔnha<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11:29 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɔnyɛ me ahi” anaa “Menvɛ yaa.”</char></note> me ɔ?<verse eid="2CO 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2CO 11:30" />Sɛ ngɔhoɔhoa me nwo a, nningyein bɔ okyire kyɛ meyɛ mmerɛ ne, ɛhene yeɛ ngɔfa ngɔhoahoa me nwo ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2CO 11:31" />Edwirɛ bɔ meka ne, Nyameɛ bɔ ɔte y'Awurade Yesu Kristo Baba, bɔ odikyɛ yɛye Ye ayɛ daa ne, ɔse kyɛ me nnaka. <verse eid="2CO 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2CO 11:32" />Mmerɛ bɔ nwɔ Damasko ne, né amrado bɔ owura Ɔhene Areta bo ne sisa kuro ne pena me kye me, <verse eid="2CO 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2CO 11:33" />nakoso, bɛfale me bɛsiele kɛndɛn nu, na bɛdwurale me bɛfale bɔen bie bɔ ɔla fasue nanwo nanu maa nwatili, yeti wannya me.<verse eid="2CO 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2CO 12" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 12:1" />Odikyɛ mehoɔhoa me nwo, ɔwɔ nu, mvasoɛ biala nne so, nakoso mebaaha anisoadehu ne nikye bie bɔ Awurade ye hyirele me nanwo dwirɛ. <verse eid="2CO 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 12:2" />Mese ebie wɔ Kristo nu bɔ afoɛ buru-ne-nná ɛhe, bɛfale<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Bɛhwimini.”</char></note> ye bɛhɔle anwuro bɔ ɔtɔ so nza naso. Sɛ né ɔte anwoɔnaen nu oo, sɛ ɔtte anwoɔnaen nu oo, ɛhene de, menze, Nyameɛ yeɛ ɔse ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 12:3" />Amba, mese sɔ sona ne. Sɛ né ɔte anwoɔnaen nu oo, sɛ ɔtte anwoɔnaen nu oo, ɛhene de, menze, Nyameɛ yeɛ ɔse ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 12:4" />Bɛfale ye bɛhɔle paradise, na ɔtele edwirɛ bɔ bɛngora ye ka, ɔne bɔ bɛmma atee mma sona nga. <verse eid="2CO 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 12:5" />Sɔ sona ne yeɛ ngɔfa ye ngɔhoɔhoa me nwo ɔ, na me bɔbɔ de, mengɔ-hoɔhoa me nwo, sana bɔ meyɛ mmerɛ wɔ nu ne. <verse eid="2CO 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 12:6" />Na sɛ mepena kyɛ mehoɔhoa me nwo a, ɛhene ngyire kyɛ nnne adwene, ofikyɛ ngɔha nahorɛ. Nakoso mengɔyɛ sɔ, na wamma ebie ammu me kyɛ metra kyɛbɔ onwu me ne, anaa bɔ ɔte fi me berɛ ne, <verse eid="2CO 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 12:7" />ɔnate anisoadehu bɔ ɔyɛ nwanwa bɔ nyane ye nati.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2CO 12:7">Yeti, bɔ ɔkɔyɛ ne mamma me nwo so maa wammo so ne, bama me bowue bie wɔ me nwonaen nu, Satan bɔfoɛ kyɛ ɔbobɔ me, kyɛbɔ ɔkɔyɛ a mengɔma me nwo so maa ɔngɔbo so ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 12:8" />Nzrɛle Awurade pɛn nza kyɛ, ɔma ofi me so. <verse eid="2CO 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 12:9" />Nakoso ɔha hyirele me kyɛ: “M'adom bɔ ɔwɔ wɔ so ne sone, ofikyɛ me tumi yɛ adwuma yé wɔ ebie nu mmerɛ bɔ wayɛ mmerɛ ne.” Yeti, ngɔfa anigye ngɔhoɔhoa me nwo wɔ me mmerɛyɛ nwo, na wamaa Kristo tumi ne atena me so. <verse eid="2CO 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 12:10" />Na Kristo ti, me nye gye ye nwo kyɛ mayɛ mmerɛ, bɛbɔ me alapaa, wahia me, mmenia tane me nye, ná me nwo ahyere me ɔ. Ofikyɛ meyɛ mmerɛ a, yeɛ menya anwoserɛ ɔ.<verse eid="2CO 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 12:11" />Mayɛ kwasea,<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:11 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ebie bɔ olle adwene.”</char></note> nakoso, ɛmɔ yeɛ ɛmɔ amaa wawa ye sɔ ɔ, ofikyɛ ɛmɔ yeɛ odikyɛ ahaa ɛmɔ kamvo me ɔ. Na sɛ nnde hwee po a, sɔ asomafoɛ atitire ne de, nikye biala nne berɛ bɔ bɛfa bɛtra me ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 12:12" />Nningyein bɔ okyire paa kyɛ nde somafoɛ ne, mvale animia paa nyɛle ye wɔ ɛmɔ berɛ; nzɛngyerɛneɛ, anwanwadeɛ, ne nningyein bɔ tumi wɔ nu. <verse eid="2CO 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 12:13" />Ye de, nzu yeɛ nyɛ mmane asafo ahoroɛ nemɔ bɔ ɛmɔ de, ɛmɔ anya bie ɔ? Me haw ngome, yeɛ mamva mangua ɛmɔ so ɔ. Mesrɛ ɛmɔ, mvomsoɛ he de, ɛmɔfa bɛhyɛ me.<verse eid="2CO 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 12:14" />Ɛmɔnea, pɛn nza so ɛhe yeɛ mayɛ krado kyɛ meba ɛmɔ berɛ ɔ, na mengɔfa me haw mengɔgua ɛmɔ so. Nná ɛmɔ ahodeɛ yeɛ mepena ɔ, mmom ɛmɔ bɔbɔ yeɛ mepena ɛmɔ ɔ, ofikyɛ nná mmaa yeɛ odikyɛ bɛpena nningyein bɛgua b'awofo berɛ ɔ, mmom awofo yeɛ odikyɛ bɛpena nningyein bɛma bɛ mmaa mɔ ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2CO 12:15" />Na me de, ɛmɔ<note caller="*" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">12:15 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Anaa “Ɛmɔ kra.”</char></note> ti, ɔkɔyɛ me fɛ kyɛ ngɔfa bɔ nne ye biala ngɔma, ná mafa me mumua ne po maboka so. Kyɛbɔ medɔ ɛmɔ paa ne, nzuati yeɛ ɛmɔ de, ɛmɔ nnɔ me sɔ ne? <verse eid="2CO 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2CO 12:16" />Ɔwɔ nu kyɛ, manyɛ adesoa biala mamma ɛmɔ, nakoso ɛmɔnwa me nye ate soma, na nnaka-naka yeɛ mva nyane ɛmɔ ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2CO 12:17" />Mmenia bɔ nzomane bɛ ɛmɔ berɛ ne, aso mvale bɛ so nnidili ɛmɔ nwo? <verse eid="2CO 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2CO 12:18" />Nzrɛle Tito, na mmaa ɔne aliemaa kõ wale ɛmɔ berɛ. Tito didili ɛmɔ nwo anaa? Daabi. Aso nná honhom komapɛ nu yeɛ yɛnate ɔ? Na nná agyire komapɛ nala yeɛ yɛtuli ɔ?<verse eid="2CO 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2CO 12:19" />Sɔ mmerɛ he amukoraati, ɛmɔ adwene yɛ ɛmɔ kyɛ yɛye yɛ nwo noa yɛkyire ɛmɔ anaa? Kristo nu yeɛ yɛdwudwo wɔ Nyameɛ nyunu ɔ. Nakoso adɔfo, ɛmɔ ngɔsoɛ ti yeɛ yɛyɛ ɛhe mukoraati ne. <verse eid="2CO 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2CO 12:20" />Bɔ mesuro yeɛ ole kyɛ sɛ meba a, annea ne mannwu ɛmɔ wɔ atee bɔ mekuro so, na ɛmɔ koso, annea né ɛmɔ anwu me yé. Na mmom ngɔwa ne, né manzoin, ahoɔyaa, ɛyaa, ngondii, bɛ gyasi ndii nu pepɛlɛ, nzekure, ahomasoɛ, ne basabasa yeɛ ɔwɔ ɛmɔ nu ɔ. <verse eid="2CO 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2CO 12:21" />Ebia meba bieku a, me Nyameɛ kɔbrɛ me ase wɔ ɛmɔ nyunu, ná mmeni pee bɔ bɛyɛle bɔne, ná banzakra b'adwene wɔ bɛ bra-bɔne, adwamammɔ, ne ahohwibra nwo ne, annea a, ngoli bɛ nwo aworaborɛ.<verse eid="2CO 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2CO 13" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2CO 13:1" />Sɛ meba ɛmɔ berɛ he a, me pɛn nza so ɛne. “Na odikyɛ edwirɛ biala gyina mmenia nyɔ anaa nza adanzeɛ so.” <verse eid="2CO 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2CO 13:2" />Ɔwɔ nu kyɛ kesaalae de nne berɛ, nakoso ɔte kyɛ bɔ nwɔ ɛmɔ berɛ, mmerɛ bɔ mma nzrale ɛmɔ pɛn nyɔ so ne. Na medi moa mebɔ bɛ bɔ bɛyɛle bɔne, ɔne bɛ bɔ baha ne kɔkɔ kyɛ, sɛ meba a, mengɔfa bɛ nwo mengɔhyɛ bɛ, <verse eid="2CO 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2CO 13:3" />ofikyɛ ɛmɔpena adanzeɛ bɔ okyire kyɛ, ɔte amba kyɛ Kristo yeɛ ɔfa me so dwudwo ɔ. Kristo nyɛ mmerɛ wɔ ɛmɔ so, mmom ole tumi wɔ ɛmɔ nu. <verse eid="2CO 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2CO 13:4" />Ɔwɔ nu, mmerɛyɛ ti yeɛ bɛbɔle ye asɛnnua nu ɔ, nakoso Nyameɛ tumi ti, ɔte ase. Yɛ koso, yɛyɛ mmerɛ kyɛbɔ ne ɔyɛ mmerɛ nala, nakoso Nyameɛ tumi bɔ wala ye ali wɔ ɛmɔ so nati, yɛne ye kɔtena ase.<verse eid="2CO 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2CO 13:5" />Ɛmɔneɛnea ɛmɔ nu bɛnea, sɛ ɛmɔtɛ́ wɔ gyidie nanu a; ɛmɔsɔ ɛmɔ nwo bɛnea, ná ɛmɔnwu kyɛbɔ ɛmɔte deinn. Anaa ɛmɔnwu ye kyɛ Yesu Kristo wɔ ɛmɔ nu? Sana ebie a, ɛmɔ mvata. <verse eid="2CO 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2CO 13:6" />Nne anidasoɛ kyɛ, ɛmɔ konwu yɛ kyɛ mmenia bɔ bɛfata. <verse eid="2CO 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2CO 13:7" />Na yɛbɔ Nyameɛ mbaeɛ kyɛ, ɛmɔngɔyɛ bɔne biala, nná kyɛ yɛpena kyɛ mmenia nwu yɛ kyɛ yɛ de yɛfata, mmom sɛ mmenia nwu yɛ kyɛ yɛmvata po a, ɛmɔ de, ɛmɔ kɔyɛ bɔ ɔte pa. <verse eid="2CO 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2CO 13:8" />Ofikyɛ yɛngɔhora yɛngɔyɛ nikye fee yɛngotia nahorɛ ne, mmom bɔ yɛyɛ biala ne, yɛyɛ yɛma nahorɛ ne. <verse eid="2CO 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2CO 13:9" />Mmerɛ biala bɔ yɛkɔyɛ mmerɛ maa ɛmɔ kɔyɛ se ne, yɛ nye gye paa. Na yɛ mbaeɛ ala yeɛ ole kyɛ, bɛkɔhɔ so bɛkosiesie ɛmɔ. <verse eid="2CO 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2CO 13:10" />Ɛhe ati yeɛ nnne berɛ, nakoso metworɔ sɔ dwirɛ he mebrɛ ɛmɔ ne, na sɛ meba a, tumi bɔ Awurade afa ama me ne, mamva manni dwumaa ma wammo so, ofikyɛ ɛmɔ ngɔsoɛ ti yeɛ ɔfa mane me ɔ, wamva wamma me kyɛ mva mmu ɛmɔ abanu.<verse eid="2CO 13:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2CO 13:11" />Aliemaa mɔ, bɔ ɔpɛ yebo koraa ne, ɛmɔma ɛmɔ nye gye, ɛmɔma bɛsiesie ɛmɔ, ɛmɔkyekye ɛmɔ nwo wora, ɛmɔnya adwene kõ, ɛmɔtena asomdwie nu; ná ɔdɔ ne asomdwie Nyameɛ ne, ɔne ɛmɔ kɔtena. <verse eid="2CO 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2CO 13:12" />Ɛmɔfa mveanoɛ bɔ ɔte krongron bɛhyeɛhyea ɛmɔ nwo.<verse eid="2CO 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2CO 13:13" />Akrongronfoɛ namukoraati nwa bɛkyea ɛmɔ.<verse eid="2CO 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2CO 13:14" />Y'Awurade Yesu Kristo adom, Nyameɛ dɔ, ɔne honhom krongron bɔ ɔboka ɛmɔ ne, ɔha ɛmɔ mukoraati.<verse eid="2CO 13:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2CO 13" />
</usx>